<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:05.359" end="00:00:12.000" style="s2">Hi, Victoria. Good news. Looks like the</p>
<p begin="00:00:09.280" end="00:00:13.360" style="s2">$10 billion contract is going underway.</p>
<p begin="00:00:12.000" end="00:00:15.839" style="s2">We&#39;ll be meeting with Jeremy in the next</p>
<p begin="00:00:13.360" end="00:00:17.680" style="s2">few days just to finalize everything.</p>
<p begin="00:00:15.839" end="00:00:18.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, Daniel.</p>
<p begin="00:00:17.680" end="00:00:20.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Looks like Jeremy&#39;s going to be hitting</p>
<p begin="00:00:18.880" end="00:00:21.600" style="s2">the headlines soon. It&#39;s a shame no one</p>
<p begin="00:00:20.240" end="00:00:23.600" style="s2">knows who&#39;s behind it at all.</p>
<p begin="00:00:21.600" end="00:00:25.439" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It has only been 3 years since the fire</p>
<p begin="00:00:23.600" end="00:00:27.599" style="s2">destroyed his company, and he&#39;d never</p>
<p begin="00:00:25.439" end="00:00:29.279" style="s2">take my help if he knew who I was. He&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:00:27.599" end="00:00:30.240" style="s2">too proud. Do you think now is the right</p>
<p begin="00:00:29.279" end="00:00:31.519" style="s2">time to tell him? What do you think</p>
<p begin="00:00:30.240" end="00:00:33.280" style="s2">he&#39;ll say?</p>
<p begin="00:00:31.519" end="00:00:35.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, Jeremy&#39;s worked so hard to be who</p>
<p begin="00:00:33.280" end="00:00:36.880" style="s2">he is. I only facilitated it. And since</p>
<p begin="00:00:35.360" end="00:00:37.680" style="s2">I&#39;m carrying his baby, I should probably</p>
<p begin="00:00:36.880" end="00:00:39.200" style="s2">be honest with him.</p>
<p begin="00:00:37.680" end="00:00:41.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I respect your decision.</p>
<p begin="00:00:39.200" end="00:00:43.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my god, it&#39;s time. I need to go my</p>
<p begin="00:00:41.280" end="00:00:45.600" style="s2">prenatal appointment now.</p>
<p begin="00:00:43.760" end="00:00:47.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go, go.</p>
<p begin="00:00:45.600" end="00:00:50.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Two months along. It&#39;s a delicate stage</p>
<p begin="00:00:47.680" end="00:00:53.039" style="s2">for the baby. Please make sure you get</p>
<p begin="00:00:50.000" end="00:00:55.840" style="s2">plenty of rest. I will once this deal is</p>
<p begin="00:00:53.039" end="00:00:56.719" style="s2">done. Three more days. Okay. See you</p>
<p begin="00:00:55.840" end="00:00:58.480" style="s2">next appointment.</p>
<p begin="00:00:56.719" end="00:01:01.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. See you then. Please read the</p>
<p begin="00:00:58.480" end="00:01:05.160" style="s2">leaflet and for anything just drop me an</p>
<p begin="00:01:01.359" end="00:01:05.160" style="s2">email. Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:01:07.119" end="00:01:12.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Khloe Mitchell, it&#39;s your turn.</p>
<p begin="00:01:09.600" end="00:01:15.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jeremy, do you mind coming in with me?</p>
<p begin="00:01:12.000" end="00:01:15.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sure.</p>
<p begin="00:01:19.680" end="00:01:24.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jeremy, what is he doing here with</p>
<p begin="00:01:21.920" end="00:01:24.920" style="s2">Chloe?</p>
<p begin="00:01:26.080" end="00:01:31.119" style="s2">Mr. Collins, you&#39;re very nice. Accompany</p>
<p begin="00:01:29.280" end="00:01:32.960" style="s2">your wife for checkups. That&#39;s very</p>
<p begin="00:01:31.119" end="00:01:34.880" style="s2">sweet. [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:01:32.960" end="00:01:37.680" style="s2">One of our patients just left. She</p>
<p begin="00:01:34.880" end="00:01:39.200" style="s2">always comes alone and looks exhausted.</p>
<p begin="00:01:37.680" end="00:01:43.439" style="s2">Looks like her husband couldn&#39;t care</p>
<p begin="00:01:39.200" end="00:01:45.040" style="s2">less. Luckily for me, Jeremy cares.</p>
<p begin="00:01:43.439" end="00:01:48.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Doctor, how&#39;s the baby?</p>
<p begin="00:01:45.040" end="00:01:50.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not to worry, the baby&#39;s very healthy.</p>
<p begin="00:01:48.000" end="00:01:52.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jeremy got his ex-girlfriend Khloe</p>
<p begin="00:01:50.799" end="00:01:54.000" style="s2">pregnant.</p>
<p begin="00:01:52.720" end="00:01:57.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jeremy?</p>
<p begin="00:01:54.000" end="00:01:59.211" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Victoria? What? How could you do this?</p>
<p begin="00:01:57.280" end="00:01:59.439" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing here, Victoria?</p>
<p begin="00:01:59.211" end="00:02:01.920" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:01:59.439" end="00:02:05.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I DON&#39;T UNDERSTAND. I&#39;M YOUR WIFE. HOW</p>
<p begin="00:02:01.920" end="00:02:06.079" style="s2">COULD YOU? DON&#39;T TOUCH ME.</p>
<p begin="00:02:05.119" end="00:02:08.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; VICTORIA,</p>
<p begin="00:02:06.079" end="00:02:10.346" style="s2">&gt;&gt; scare me. I&#39;m not feeling too well.</p>
<p begin="00:02:08.399" end="00:02:10.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Doctor, doctor, check on her, please.</p>
<p begin="00:02:10.346" end="00:02:12.959" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:02:10.720" end="00:02:15.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The baby will be fine. Don&#39;t worry. I</p>
<p begin="00:02:12.959" end="00:02:16.160" style="s2">will prescribe you some medications. You</p>
<p begin="00:02:15.200" end="00:02:20.120" style="s2">can wait here.</p>
<p begin="00:02:16.160" end="00:02:20.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m going to get some air.</p>
<p begin="00:02:23.120" end="00:02:28.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know what, Victoria? Jeremy was</p>
<p begin="00:02:25.360" end="00:02:30.720" style="s2">never yours to begin with.</p>
<p begin="00:02:28.160" end="00:02:32.160" style="s2">I&#39;m his high school sweetheart. If it</p>
<p begin="00:02:30.720" end="00:02:35.040" style="s2">weren&#39;t for you, I&#39;d be his wife</p>
<p begin="00:02:32.160" end="00:02:37.040" style="s2">already.</p>
<p begin="00:02:35.040" end="00:02:39.200" style="s2">You are out of your mind. You can be in</p>
<p begin="00:02:37.040" end="00:02:40.959" style="s2">denial all you want, but for him, you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:02:39.200" end="00:02:42.959" style="s2">just a convenience. He got together with</p>
<p begin="00:02:40.959" end="00:02:45.280" style="s2">you cuz I was away. You left him 3 years</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.959" end="00:02:46.560" style="s2">ago because he went bankrupt. The only</p>
<p begin="00:02:45.280" end="00:02:47.920" style="s2">reason you are back is because the</p>
<p begin="00:02:46.560" end="00:02:51.480" style="s2">business is doing well. I&#39;m right,</p>
<p begin="00:02:47.920" end="00:02:51.480" style="s2">aren&#39;t I? You [ __ ]</p>
<p begin="00:02:52.480" end="00:02:57.840" style="s2">You hit me. Are you insane? I&#39;m a</p>
<p begin="00:02:55.440" end="00:03:00.319" style="s2">pregnant woman. You might be smart, but</p>
<p begin="00:02:57.840" end="00:03:04.480" style="s2">even so, it doesn&#39;t matter. Jeremy&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:03:00.319" end="00:03:06.720" style="s2">choosing me. I&#39;m carrying his child.</p>
<p begin="00:03:04.480" end="00:03:09.440" style="s2">Actually, the baby&#39;s not his, but I</p>
<p begin="00:03:06.720" end="00:03:12.480" style="s2">won&#39;t let anyone find out the truth.</p>
<p begin="00:03:09.440" end="00:03:15.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jeremy and I were both drunk that night.</p>
<p begin="00:03:12.480" end="00:03:17.200" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry, Victoria, but the baby is</p>
<p begin="00:03:15.440" end="00:03:20.239" style="s2">innocent.</p>
<p begin="00:03:17.200" end="00:03:21.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you okay?</p>
<p begin="00:03:20.239" end="00:03:24.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can&#39;t you see? She&#39;s just faking it.</p>
<p begin="00:03:21.680" end="00:03:25.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t make a scene. I&#39;m making a scene.</p>
<p begin="00:03:24.239" end="00:03:26.720" style="s2">Did you or did you not sleep with her?</p>
<p begin="00:03:25.920" end="00:03:29.602" style="s2">Well,</p>
<p begin="00:03:26.720" end="00:03:30.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:03:29.602" end="00:03:33.519" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:03:30.159" end="00:03:37.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought so. I want a divorce.</p>
<p begin="00:03:33.519" end="00:03:37.560" style="s2">Jeremy. Jeremy.</p>
<p begin="00:03:39.840" end="00:03:47.560" style="s2">This is it. 3 years wasted. I can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:03:44.000" end="00:03:47.560" style="s2">believe it&#39;s over.</p>
<p begin="00:03:52.000" end="00:03:57.519" style="s2">Victoria, Khloe told me everything. How</p>
<p begin="00:03:55.360" end="00:03:58.560" style="s2">could you hurt Chloe? Do you know she&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:03:57.519" end="00:04:00.959" style="s2">pregnant?</p>
<p begin="00:03:58.560" end="00:04:02.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You knew about Jeremy&#39;s affair. Chloe</p>
<p begin="00:04:00.959" end="00:04:04.959" style="s2">has been helping him. She&#39;s been doing a</p>
<p begin="00:04:02.640" end="00:04:06.959" style="s2">lot for this family. You haven&#39;t lifted</p>
<p begin="00:04:04.959" end="00:04:09.040" style="s2">a finger. It would only be fair to</p>
<p begin="00:04:06.959" end="00:04:11.360" style="s2">Jeremy if you got a divorce. Jeremy</p>
<p begin="00:04:09.040" end="00:04:13.280" style="s2">wants you to sign these and get out.</p>
<p begin="00:04:11.360" end="00:04:15.040" style="s2">Out. We&#39;ll speak about the divorce</p>
<p begin="00:04:13.280" end="00:04:18.000" style="s2">ourselves. Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:04:15.040" end="00:04:20.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not so fast. Sign them. You won&#39;t leave</p>
<p begin="00:04:18.000" end="00:04:23.520" style="s2">until it&#39;s over.</p>
<p begin="00:04:20.720" end="00:04:24.320" style="s2">Victoria, stop it. WHAT ARE YOU DOING TO</p>
<p begin="00:04:23.520" end="00:04:26.000" style="s2">MY MOTHER?</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.320" end="00:04:26.479" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you blind? Did you see what she just</p>
<p begin="00:04:26.000" end="00:04:28.240" style="s2">did to me?</p>
<p begin="00:04:26.479" end="00:04:30.479" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You assaulted my mother.</p>
<p begin="00:04:28.240" end="00:04:31.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at this. Don&#39;t make such a fuss,</p>
<p begin="00:04:30.479" end="00:04:34.919" style="s2">Victoria.</p>
<p begin="00:04:31.120" end="00:04:34.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough. Stop this fighting.</p>
<p begin="00:04:35.440" end="00:04:39.840" style="s2">What the hell do you want?</p>
<p begin="00:04:36.880" end="00:04:43.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s going on?</p>
<p begin="00:04:39.840" end="00:04:45.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay. Okay, I got it. Pinnacle Group</p>
<p begin="00:04:43.600" end="00:04:47.280" style="s2">just put forward a deal worth $10</p>
<p begin="00:04:45.040" end="00:04:51.440" style="s2">billion for our company. We&#39;ll sign in</p>
<p begin="00:04:47.280" end="00:04:53.520" style="s2">three. That&#39;s fantastic news. Oh, Chloe</p>
<p begin="00:04:51.440" end="00:04:56.160" style="s2">is good luck. I&#39;m the one that handed</p>
<p begin="00:04:53.520" end="00:04:58.320" style="s2">over that deal for 10 billion. Chloe has</p>
<p begin="00:04:56.160" end="00:05:01.958" style="s2">nothing to do with it. [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:04:58.320" end="00:05:02.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? You run the Pinnacle Group now?</p>
<p begin="00:05:01.958" end="00:05:03.680" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:05:02.720" end="00:05:06.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do.</p>
<p begin="00:05:03.680" end="00:05:08.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Victoria, come on. Pinnacle Group is one</p>
<p begin="00:05:06.720" end="00:05:09.280" style="s2">of the biggest companies in the world.</p>
<p begin="00:05:08.080" end="00:05:10.240" style="s2">Don&#39;t be ridiculous.</p>
<p begin="00:05:09.280" end="00:05:12.479" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m telling the truth.</p>
<p begin="00:05:10.240" end="00:05:13.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jeremy, why not put Khloe in charge of</p>
<p begin="00:05:12.479" end="00:05:15.360" style="s2">this billion project?</p>
<p begin="00:05:13.759" end="00:05:17.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can&#39;t be serious.</p>
<p begin="00:05:15.360" end="00:05:19.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, just stay OUT OF IT. YOU&#39;RE NOT PART</p>
<p begin="00:05:17.600" end="00:05:20.720" style="s2">OF THIS family anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:05:19.440" end="00:05:24.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, stop this.</p>
<p begin="00:05:20.720" end="00:05:24.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just get out.</p>
<p begin="00:05:25.840" end="00:05:31.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sign this and I will leave without</p>
<p begin="00:05:28.320" end="00:05:34.240" style="s2">taking a penny. Sign them.</p>
<p begin="00:05:31.759" end="00:05:36.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You prepared divorce papers?</p>
<p begin="00:05:34.240" end="00:05:39.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t you told her to do it?</p>
<p begin="00:05:36.080" end="00:05:42.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? No. That&#39;s crazy. I never asked</p>
<p begin="00:05:39.039" end="00:05:44.400" style="s2">her to do that.</p>
<p begin="00:05:42.160" end="00:05:46.880" style="s2">When we had our wedding day, I made a</p>
<p begin="00:05:44.400" end="00:05:51.080" style="s2">commitment.</p>
<p begin="00:05:46.880" end="00:05:51.080" style="s2">I committed myself to you.</p>
<p begin="00:05:51.083" end="00:05:54.320" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:05:52.160" end="00:05:56.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve always just wanted you.</p>
<p begin="00:05:54.320" end="00:05:58.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You had an affair.</p>
<p begin="00:05:56.960" end="00:06:01.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jeremy,</p>
<p begin="00:05:58.960" end="00:06:01.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; no, it&#39;s not like that. Just listen to</p>
<p begin="00:06:01.280" end="00:06:03.520" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:06:01.600" end="00:06:05.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re insane. You were in the hospital</p>
<p begin="00:06:03.520" end="00:06:08.160" style="s2">with her for a prenatal checkup. I saw</p>
<p begin="00:06:05.360" end="00:06:11.039" style="s2">both of you.</p>
<p begin="00:06:08.160" end="00:06:12.880" style="s2">Sign it and I will leave.</p>
<p begin="00:06:11.039" end="00:06:15.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No,</p>
<p begin="00:06:12.880" end="00:06:18.639" style="s2">Victoria, don&#39;t. You wouldn&#39;t survive</p>
<p begin="00:06:15.440" end="00:06:22.680" style="s2">without me.</p>
<p begin="00:06:18.639" end="00:06:22.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll be fine on my own.</p>
<p begin="00:06:22.800" end="00:06:26.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not signing them.</p>
<p begin="00:06:24.160" end="00:06:29.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whatever. I&#39;m leaving anyway.</p>
<p begin="00:06:26.880" end="00:06:30.720" style="s2">Hold on a minute. What else do you want?</p>
<p begin="00:06:29.120" end="00:06:32.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The clothes you are wearing, Jeremy</p>
<p begin="00:06:30.720" end="00:06:35.280" style="s2">bought them for you. Since you are</p>
<p begin="00:06:32.560" end="00:06:37.199" style="s2">leaving with nothing, take them off.</p>
<p begin="00:06:35.280" end="00:06:39.039" style="s2">Fine. Take it all. Remember it was</p>
<p begin="00:06:37.199" end="00:06:40.880" style="s2">raining. You bought me that. Got this in</p>
<p begin="00:06:39.039" end="00:06:43.759" style="s2">a raffle on our first anniversary. And</p>
<p begin="00:06:40.880" end="00:06:47.400" style="s2">this,</p>
<p begin="00:06:43.759" end="00:06:47.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Toria, don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:06:54.319" end="00:06:58.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t need that anymore,</p>
<p begin="00:07:01.360" end="00:07:04.360" style="s2">Victoria.</p>
<p begin="00:07:22.160" end="00:07:26.000" style="s2">Jeremy,</p>
<p begin="00:07:24.720" end="00:07:27.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; what are you doing here? You should be</p>
<p begin="00:07:26.000" end="00:07:29.759" style="s2">resting in bed.</p>
<p begin="00:07:27.360" end="00:07:31.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have good news. Who&#39;s that man in the</p>
<p begin="00:07:29.759" end="00:07:34.319" style="s2">car with Victoria?</p>
<p begin="00:07:31.840" end="00:07:37.280" style="s2">That [ __ ] She&#39;s been seeing him all</p>
<p begin="00:07:34.319" end="00:07:37.280" style="s2">this time.</p>
<p begin="00:07:37.360" end="00:07:42.319" style="s2">Victoria, is this why you&#39;re leaving me?</p>
<p begin="00:07:40.479" end="00:07:45.280" style="s2">You&#39;ve been seeing someone else.</p>
<p begin="00:07:42.319" end="00:07:48.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jeremy, she doesn&#39;t deserve you. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:07:45.280" end="00:07:50.880" style="s2">always be here for you. Exactly. Now</p>
<p begin="00:07:48.160" end="00:07:52.160" style="s2">that Victoria&#39;s gone, you two can be</p>
<p begin="00:07:50.880" end="00:07:54.080" style="s2">together.</p>
<p begin="00:07:52.160" end="00:07:56.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, Chloe and I are not</p>
<p begin="00:07:54.080" end="00:07:59.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jeremy. Chloe has risked her life for</p>
<p begin="00:07:56.639" end="00:07:59.639" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:08:12.000" end="00:08:15.520" style="s2">Thank you for everything you&#39;ve done for</p>
<p begin="00:08:14.479" end="00:08:18.319" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:08:15.520" end="00:08:20.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m willing to do anything for you. I</p>
<p begin="00:08:18.319" end="00:08:22.400" style="s2">just want what&#39;s best for you. Which</p>
<p begin="00:08:20.240" end="00:08:24.479" style="s2">reminds me, my uncle called. He</p>
<p begin="00:08:22.400" end="00:08:26.240" style="s2">convinced the CEO of Pinnacle Group to</p>
<p begin="00:08:24.479" end="00:08:27.360" style="s2">give your company a10 billion dollar</p>
<p begin="00:08:26.240" end="00:08:28.560" style="s2">contract.</p>
<p begin="00:08:27.360" end="00:08:31.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your uncle?</p>
<p begin="00:08:28.560" end="00:08:36.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah. He&#39;s a big hill at Pinnacle Group.</p>
<p begin="00:08:31.120" end="00:08:36.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, Chloe. I owe you so much.</p>
<p begin="00:08:39.039" end="00:08:42.919" style="s2">Hey, you okay?</p>
<p begin="00:08:44.080" end="00:08:50.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah. I&#39;m sorry. I worried you.</p>
<p begin="00:08:46.399" end="00:08:50.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s all right. It&#39;s not your fault.</p>
<p begin="00:08:53.839" end="00:08:59.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah. To think I was going to have his</p>
<p begin="00:08:55.920" end="00:08:59.399" style="s2">baby as well.</p>
<p begin="00:08:59.726" end="00:09:04.399" style="s2">[panting and sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:09:01.279" end="00:09:05.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know. I&#39;m sorry. It&#39;s unforgivable.</p>
<p begin="00:09:04.399" end="00:09:09.600" style="s2">It&#39;s unforgivable. He didn&#39;t deserve</p>
<p begin="00:09:05.920" end="00:09:11.440" style="s2">you. You saved him from a fire, got</p>
<p begin="00:09:09.600" end="00:09:14.920" style="s2">hurt, and had to sacrifice your whole</p>
<p begin="00:09:11.440" end="00:09:14.920" style="s2">career for him.</p>
<p begin="00:09:22.399" end="00:09:26.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah,</p>
<p begin="00:09:23.920" end="00:09:30.760" style="s2">let&#39;s just move on.</p>
<p begin="00:09:26.160" end="00:09:30.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about the 10 billion contract?</p>
<p begin="00:09:34.000" end="00:09:40.200" style="s2">He&#39;s put Khloe in charge of that.</p>
<p begin="00:09:37.200" end="00:09:40.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:09:40.959" end="00:09:47.279" style="s2">Arrogant prick. I should just cancel</p>
<p begin="00:09:43.519" end="00:09:51.120" style="s2">that deal right now.</p>
<p begin="00:09:47.279" end="00:09:53.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Actually, let&#39;s wait a bit. The longer</p>
<p begin="00:09:51.120" end="00:09:57.640" style="s2">we wait,</p>
<p begin="00:09:53.680" end="00:09:57.640" style="s2">the worse it would sting.</p>
<p begin="00:09:58.399" end="00:10:02.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it. We should cancel our partnering</p>
<p begin="00:10:00.880" end="00:10:03.760" style="s2">ceremony.</p>
<p begin="00:10:02.480" end="00:10:05.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh yes.</p>
<p begin="00:10:03.760" end="00:10:06.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can&#39;t wait to see everyone&#39;s face when</p>
<p begin="00:10:05.360" end="00:10:08.160" style="s2">they find out that you are the CEO of</p>
<p begin="00:10:06.800" end="00:10:11.800" style="s2">Pinnacle Group.</p>
<p begin="00:10:08.160" end="00:10:11.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t wait either.</p>
<p begin="00:10:12.320" end="00:10:15.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come in.</p>
<p begin="00:10:21.200" end="00:10:26.000" style="s2">How exciting to be at the Pinnacle Group</p>
<p begin="00:10:23.279" end="00:10:29.519" style="s2">signing ceremony. The Pinnacle Group CEO</p>
<p begin="00:10:26.000" end="00:10:32.880" style="s2">hasn&#39;t made a public appearance yet, but</p>
<p begin="00:10:29.519" end="00:10:35.920" style="s2">he will be coming in person. That is</p>
<p begin="00:10:32.880" end="00:10:37.760" style="s2">something. After today, everybody will</p>
<p begin="00:10:35.920" end="00:10:39.680" style="s2">know.</p>
<p begin="00:10:37.760" end="00:10:41.519" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We haven&#39;t yet signed the contracts yet,</p>
<p begin="00:10:39.680" end="00:10:43.839" style="s2">Mom. Let&#39;s not get ahead of ourselves</p>
<p begin="00:10:41.519" end="00:10:45.839" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:10:43.839" end="00:10:47.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry, Jeremy. My uncle will be in</p>
<p begin="00:10:45.839" end="00:10:49.440" style="s2">today. The contract is practically in</p>
<p begin="00:10:47.920" end="00:10:51.760" style="s2">the bag.</p>
<p begin="00:10:49.440" end="00:10:53.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, that was the Pinnacle Group CEO</p>
<p begin="00:10:51.760" end="00:10:55.600" style="s2">that&#39;s just arrived,</p>
<p begin="00:10:53.120" end="00:10:55.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; right?</p>
<p begin="00:10:55.680" end="00:10:59.560" style="s2">Come on, let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:11:05.680" end="00:11:12.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No way.</p>
<p begin="00:11:08.880" end="00:11:12.200" style="s2">No way.</p>
<p begin="00:11:17.279" end="00:11:24.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What the heck is Victoria doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:11:20.640" end="00:11:30.519" style="s2">Isn&#39;t that the man from the car? Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:11:24.560" end="00:11:30.519" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How she moved on from me this quickly?</p>
<p begin="00:11:31.760" end="00:11:37.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:11:34.320" end="00:11:39.760" style="s2">Did you copy me the email address?</p>
<p begin="00:11:37.120" end="00:11:42.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, I did. What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:11:39.760" end="00:11:45.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get off me.</p>
<p begin="00:11:42.880" end="00:11:47.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Victoria is under my care now. Please</p>
<p begin="00:11:45.600" end="00:11:52.079" style="s2">act appropriately. Victoria, we&#39;re not</p>
<p begin="00:11:47.600" end="00:11:56.000" style="s2">divorced yet. You are so shameless.</p>
<p begin="00:11:52.079" end="00:11:58.160" style="s2">me shameless.</p>
<p begin="00:11:56.000" end="00:11:59.760" style="s2">You got your mistress pregnant and you</p>
<p begin="00:11:58.160" end="00:12:02.480" style="s2">want to call me shameless.</p>
<p begin="00:11:59.760" end="00:12:03.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, Mr. Collins isn&#39;t so squeaky clean</p>
<p begin="00:12:02.480" end="00:12:06.240" style="s2">after all.</p>
<p begin="00:12:03.279" end="00:12:09.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah. So, that woman is his mistress.</p>
<p begin="00:12:06.240" end="00:12:09.240" style="s2">Interesting.</p>
<p begin="00:12:13.839" end="00:12:18.079" style="s2">You beach. How dare you start nasty</p>
<p begin="00:12:16.480" end="00:12:21.079" style="s2">rumors about us in front of all these</p>
<p begin="00:12:18.079" end="00:12:21.079" style="s2">people?</p>
<p begin="00:12:22.160" end="00:12:26.160" style="s2">You beach. How dare you start nasty</p>
<p begin="00:12:24.560" end="00:12:29.160" style="s2">rumors about us in front of all these</p>
<p begin="00:12:26.160" end="00:12:29.160" style="s2">people.</p>
<p begin="00:12:30.560" end="00:12:38.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are not going to bully me again.</p>
<p begin="00:12:34.639" end="00:12:40.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Victoria, relax. She&#39;s pregnant.</p>
<p begin="00:12:38.000" end="00:12:41.839" style="s2">Victoria was defending herself. You</p>
<p begin="00:12:40.000" end="00:12:43.440" style="s2">accuse her and she&#39;s done nothing wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:12:41.839" end="00:12:45.200" style="s2">This is a family affair. It&#39;s none of</p>
<p begin="00:12:43.440" end="00:12:47.040" style="s2">your damn business. Your manners are</p>
<p begin="00:12:45.200" end="00:12:48.639" style="s2">terrible and you have no qualifications</p>
<p begin="00:12:47.040" end="00:12:50.320" style="s2">to sign the contract for the Pinnacle</p>
<p begin="00:12:48.639" end="00:12:52.240" style="s2">Group. How dare you speak to us like</p>
<p begin="00:12:50.320" end="00:12:54.720" style="s2">that? We have business with the Pinnacle</p>
<p begin="00:12:52.240" end="00:12:56.959" style="s2">Group. We&#39;re their guests. Security.</p>
<p begin="00:12:54.720" end="00:13:00.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not so fast.</p>
<p begin="00:12:56.959" end="00:13:02.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Victoria, you shameless woman hanging on</p>
<p begin="00:13:00.480" end="00:13:03.839" style="s2">another man&#39;s arm in front of Jeremy.</p>
<p begin="00:13:02.399" end="00:13:05.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Pinnacle Group will not be involved</p>
<p begin="00:13:03.839" end="00:13:07.040" style="s2">in any projects with the Collins family</p>
<p begin="00:13:05.839" end="00:13:08.240" style="s2">or Miss Mitchell.</p>
<p begin="00:13:07.040" end="00:13:10.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And who do you think you are in the</p>
<p begin="00:13:08.240" end="00:13:11.920" style="s2">Pinnacle Group? Canceling a 10 billion</p>
<p begin="00:13:10.639" end="00:13:13.600" style="s2">project like it&#39;s nothing.</p>
