<p begin="00:13:22.720" end="00:13:27.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Listen, lady. This is the deputy CEO of</p>
<p begin="00:13:24.800" end="00:13:29.920" style="s2">Pinnacold&#39;s group. So, calm down.</p>
<p begin="00:13:27.200" end="00:13:31.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Deputy CEO.</p>
<p begin="00:13:29.920" end="00:13:34.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Victoria must have hired an idiot to</p>
<p begin="00:13:31.920" end="00:13:39.320" style="s2">impersonate the deputy CEO. I did no</p>
<p begin="00:13:34.480" end="00:13:39.320" style="s2">such thing. Come on, Daniel. Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:13:42.000" end="00:13:46.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jeremy. Oh, I got you an umbrella. Oh my</p>
<p begin="00:13:45.440" end="00:13:49.040" style="s2">gosh, you&#39;re soaked.</p>
<p begin="00:13:46.560" end="00:13:50.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am. I&#39;m absolutely drenched.</p>
<p begin="00:13:49.040" end="00:13:52.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you okay?</p>
<p begin="00:13:50.160" end="00:13:55.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, I&#39;m all right. I was a bit</p>
<p begin="00:13:52.399" end="00:13:55.399" style="s2">distracted.</p>
<p begin="00:13:56.800" end="00:14:00.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, honey.</p>
<p begin="00:14:00.320" end="00:14:04.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jeremy, you don&#39;t look so good. Do you</p>
<p begin="00:14:02.240" end="00:14:07.560" style="s2">need a break?</p>
<p begin="00:14:04.560" end="00:14:07.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:14:08.560" end="00:14:13.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mrs. Collins, Jeremy was upset earlier.</p>
<p begin="00:14:11.839" end="00:14:15.920" style="s2">Is it because he still has feelings for</p>
<p begin="00:14:13.680" end="00:14:18.240" style="s2">Victoria? Don&#39;t worry, you&#39;re the only</p>
<p begin="00:14:15.920" end="00:14:20.800" style="s2">one Jeremy&#39;s ever loved.</p>
<p begin="00:14:18.240" end="00:14:22.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But I can&#39;t shake off this feeling. What</p>
<p begin="00:14:20.800" end="00:14:23.760" style="s2">if Victoria tries to make something at</p>
<p begin="00:14:22.560" end="00:14:25.760" style="s2">the signing ceremon?</p>
<p begin="00:14:23.760" end="00:14:27.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is Victoria. She is Pinnacle Group</p>
<p begin="00:14:25.760" end="00:14:29.680" style="s2">CE.</p>
<p begin="00:14:27.120" end="00:14:33.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry. Excuse me. I have to take this.</p>
<p begin="00:14:29.680" end="00:14:34.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Victoria, I clearly underestimated you.</p>
<p begin="00:14:33.040" end="00:14:36.560" style="s2">You&#39;re quite charismatic, already</p>
<p begin="00:14:34.720" end="00:14:38.000" style="s2">seducing another man.</p>
<p begin="00:14:36.560" end="00:14:40.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are these ladies?</p>
<p begin="00:14:38.000" end="00:14:43.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just nobodyies. Victoria is my former</p>
<p begin="00:14:40.720" end="00:14:45.360" style="s2">daughter-in-law. seems to have a thing</p>
<p begin="00:14:43.040" end="00:14:48.240" style="s2">for wealthy men.</p>
<p begin="00:14:45.360" end="00:14:50.880" style="s2">Don&#39;t be fooled by that pretty face.</p>
