<p begin="00:14:56.320" end="00:15:03.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You [ __ ] Jeremy will never forgive you</p>
<p begin="00:14:58.880" end="00:15:03.639" style="s2">for this. I don&#39;t give a [ __ ]</p>
<p begin="00:15:08.160" end="00:15:12.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You need to stop antagonizing Chloe.</p>
<p begin="00:15:10.160" end="00:15:15.519" style="s2">She&#39;s in a delicate stage.</p>
<p begin="00:15:12.480" end="00:15:19.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then tell her to get out of my face.</p>
