<p begin="00:15:20.959" end="00:15:26.560" style="s2">You parade your mistress around. Get the</p>
<p begin="00:15:23.760" end="00:15:28.320" style="s2">hell out of here.</p>
<p begin="00:15:26.560" end="00:15:30.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This place is owned by the Pinnacle</p>
<p begin="00:15:28.320" end="00:15:32.959" style="s2">Group. Do you know the repercussions for</p>
<p begin="00:15:30.240" end="00:15:35.040" style="s2">impersonating someone so powerful?</p>
<p begin="00:15:32.959" end="00:15:38.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Since we&#39;re no longer together, I don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:15:35.040" end="00:15:41.440" style="s2">feel that&#39;s any of your concerns.</p>
