<p begin="00:15:41.440" end="00:15:46.440" style="s2">You think you can do whatever you want,</p>
<p begin="00:15:43.440" end="00:15:46.440" style="s2">huh?</p>
<p begin="00:15:46.800" end="00:15:52.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No idea what you&#39;re talking about.</p>
<p begin="00:15:50.000" end="00:15:54.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jeremy, just ignore her. She&#39;ll get us</p>
<p begin="00:15:52.560" end="00:15:57.320" style="s2">into trouble if she offends the Pinnacle</p>
<p begin="00:15:54.320" end="00:15:57.320" style="s2">group.</p>
<p begin="00:15:57.621" end="00:16:01.040" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:15:58.480" end="00:16:03.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry. My uncle will be here soon,</p>
<p begin="00:16:01.040" end="00:16:05.920" style="s2">and he&#39;ll ruin her.</p>
<p begin="00:16:03.759" end="00:16:07.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And who is your uncle?</p>
<p begin="00:16:05.920" end="00:16:10.800" style="s2">My uncle is the one in charge of the</p>
<p begin="00:16:07.920" end="00:16:14.800" style="s2">billiondollar project.</p>
<p begin="00:16:10.800" end="00:16:16.560" style="s2">Look, there he is now.</p>
<p begin="00:16:14.800" end="00:16:19.440" style="s2">I hear someone has been stirring up</p>
<p begin="00:16:16.560" end="00:16:24.160" style="s2">[ __ ] pretending to be the CEO of the</p>
<p begin="00:16:19.440" end="00:16:26.800" style="s2">Pinnacle Project, assaulting guests.</p>
<p begin="00:16:24.160" end="00:16:31.519" style="s2">Who is responsible?</p>
<p begin="00:16:26.800" end="00:16:33.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She is the one responsible. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:16:31.519" end="00:16:35.519" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You?</p>
<p begin="00:16:33.600" end="00:16:37.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, me.</p>
<p begin="00:16:35.519" end="00:16:40.480" style="s2">You think you can just waltz in here and</p>
<p begin="00:16:37.920" end="00:16:43.120" style="s2">interrupt our meeting? You&#39;re asking for</p>
<p begin="00:16:40.480" end="00:16:46.160" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:16:43.120" end="00:16:50.076" style="s2">But before you&#39;re escorted out, I want</p>
<p begin="00:16:46.160" end="00:16:50.076" style="s2">you to apologize. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:16:51.839" end="00:16:56.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uncle, look. She attacked me.</p>
