<p begin="00:17:01.839" end="00:17:09.520" style="s2">property. WHO DO YOU THINK YOU ARE?</p>
<p begin="00:17:06.480" end="00:17:12.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not going to get away with this.</p>
<p begin="00:17:09.520" end="00:17:13.439" style="s2">Take her out. Hey, Mr. Mitchell, there&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:17:12.640" end="00:17:17.959" style="s2">no need.</p>
<p begin="00:17:13.439" end="00:17:17.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jeremy, she nearly ruined the signing.</p>
<p begin="00:17:18.799" end="00:17:24.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jeremy, let it go.</p>
<p begin="00:17:22.000" end="00:17:24.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hold it right there.</p>
<p begin="00:17:24.736" end="00:17:28.160" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:17:24.880" end="00:17:30.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re impostors. He&#39;s her lover,</p>
<p begin="00:17:28.160" end="00:17:33.039" style="s2">pretending to be the Pinnacle Group&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:17:30.000" end="00:17:37.480" style="s2">deputy CEO. Shut your DAMN OUT.</p>
<p begin="00:17:33.039" end="00:17:37.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; DISRESPECT THE DEPUTY CEO.</p>
<p begin="00:17:40.000" end="00:17:46.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MR. HARRISON, I&#39;m sorry. I didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:17:43.520" end="00:17:49.440" style="s2">realize that she was your companion.</p>
<p begin="00:17:46.960" end="00:17:52.880" style="s2">I I was out of line. Don&#39;t waste your</p>
<p begin="00:17:49.440" end="00:17:55.679" style="s2">apology on me.</p>
<p begin="00:17:52.880" end="00:17:58.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look, Miss, I&#39;m sorry. I I I apologize</p>
<p begin="00:17:55.679" end="00:18:00.080" style="s2">for disrespecting you earlier. Look,</p>
<p begin="00:17:58.320" end="00:18:01.760" style="s2">please forgive me.</p>
<p begin="00:18:00.080" end="00:18:03.520" style="s2">The tune has changed a lot in the past</p>
<p begin="00:18:01.760" end="00:18:04.720" style="s2">few seconds. I seem to recall you</p>
<p begin="00:18:03.520" end="00:18:06.960" style="s2">threatened me.</p>
<p begin="00:18:04.720" end="00:18:09.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look, I I I was out of line. I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:18:06.960" end="00:18:11.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, that&#39;s not fair,</p>
<p begin="00:18:09.039" end="00:18:12.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Harrison. It&#39;s my project. I can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:18:11.600" end="00:18:14.160" style="s2">just leave.</p>
<p begin="00:18:12.480" end="00:18:16.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re easily replaceable.</p>
<p begin="00:18:14.160" end="00:18:18.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But But the CEO is coming. You can&#39;t let</p>
<p begin="00:18:16.240" end="00:18:19.600" style="s2">this woman disrupt that contract</p>
<p begin="00:18:18.000" end="00:18:22.160" style="s2">signing.</p>
<p begin="00:18:19.600" end="00:18:23.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on, Mr. Harrison. Don&#39;t you think</p>
<p begin="00:18:22.160" end="00:18:26.240" style="s2">you&#39;re crossing the line?</p>
<p begin="00:18:23.600" end="00:18:28.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you two, you&#39;re scheming to hurt</p>
<p begin="00:18:26.240" end="00:18:32.200" style="s2">Victoria, weren&#39;t you? Please remove</p>
<p begin="00:18:28.559" end="00:18:32.200" style="s2">them from this place.</p>
<p begin="00:18:32.320" end="00:18:37.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How dare you?</p>
<p begin="00:18:34.799" end="00:18:39.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Harrison, please. They&#39;re both here</p>
<p begin="00:18:37.360" end="00:18:41.039" style="s2">representing the Collins group. They</p>
<p begin="00:18:39.120" end="00:18:42.320" style="s2">must be present at the contract signing.</p>
<p begin="00:18:41.039" end="00:18:45.039" style="s2">The only person who needs to complete</p>
<p begin="00:18:42.320" end="00:18:46.640" style="s2">this deal is you. And these two have</p>
<p begin="00:18:45.039" end="00:18:48.559" style="s2">been nothing but trouble.</p>
<p begin="00:18:46.640" end="00:18:50.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Harrison, you&#39;re just the deputy</p>
<p begin="00:18:48.559" end="00:18:53.120" style="s2">CEO. Aren&#39;t you worried that the actual</p>
<p begin="00:18:50.960" end="00:18:55.280" style="s2">CEO will discipline you</p>
<p begin="00:18:53.120" end="00:18:56.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; for taking Victoria&#39;s side? Discipline</p>
<p begin="00:18:55.280" end="00:18:57.760" style="s2">me? I don&#39;t know. What do you think</p>
<p begin="00:18:56.799" end="00:18:59.600" style="s2">about that, Victoria?</p>
<p begin="00:18:57.760" end="00:19:02.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Um, I think the CEO would approve.</p>
<p begin="00:18:59.600" end="00:19:04.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Victoria, stop this nonsense. Just come</p>
<p begin="00:19:02.320" end="00:19:07.600" style="s2">home with me. I can talk things through,</p>
<p begin="00:19:04.559" end="00:19:09.600" style="s2">okay? I can smooth things over. Just</p>
<p begin="00:19:07.600" end="00:19:12.080" style="s2">apologize and it&#39;ll be done.</p>
<p begin="00:19:09.600" end="00:19:14.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jeremy, just ignore her. She&#39;s only</p>
<p begin="00:19:12.080" end="00:19:16.400" style="s2">dating the deputy CEO. Once you&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:19:14.480" end="00:19:19.760" style="s2">signed the billion-dollar contract,</p>
<p begin="00:19:16.400" end="00:19:21.200" style="s2">you&#39;ll be in charge.</p>
<p begin="00:19:19.760" end="00:19:23.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s a shame that signing won&#39;t be</p>
<p begin="00:19:21.200" end="00:19:26.799" style="s2">happening then.</p>
<p begin="00:19:23.520" end="00:19:28.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you mean? Well, Chloe here</p>
<p begin="00:19:26.799" end="00:19:30.240" style="s2">knowingly got involved with a married</p>
<p begin="00:19:28.559" end="00:19:32.240" style="s2">man. Now, that kind of poor judgment</p>
<p begin="00:19:30.240" end="00:19:34.080" style="s2">reflects very, very badly on the Collins</p>
<p begin="00:19:32.240" end="00:19:37.039" style="s2">group. The Pinnacle group won&#39;t be doing</p>
<p begin="00:19:34.080" end="00:19:39.280" style="s2">no business with you. You</p>
<p begin="00:19:37.039" end="00:19:43.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The 10 billion project reopened for</p>
<p begin="00:19:39.280" end="00:19:43.880" style="s2">bidding. Any group may participate</p>
<p begin="00:19:44.240" end="00:19:50.400" style="s2">except the Collins Group. Who gives you</p>
<p begin="00:19:46.720" end="00:19:53.600" style="s2">the power to cancel it? Mr. Harrison,</p>
<p begin="00:19:50.400" end="00:19:56.559" style="s2">you&#39;re the deputy CEO. How can you let</p>
<p begin="00:19:53.600" end="00:19:58.880" style="s2">her run wild like that?</p>
<p begin="00:19:56.559" end="00:20:00.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because she calls the last shots at the</p>
<p begin="00:19:58.880" end="00:20:01.200" style="s2">pinnacle group.</p>
<p begin="00:20:00.400" end="00:20:06.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:20:01.200" end="00:20:08.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because I am the CEO.</p>
<p begin="00:20:06.480" end="00:20:10.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:20:08.160" end="00:20:13.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because I am the CEO.</p>
<p begin="00:20:10.320" end="00:20:15.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No way. My uncle is a director at the</p>
<p begin="00:20:13.280" end="00:20:19.360" style="s2">Pinnacle Group. He&#39;d know the CEO.</p>
<p begin="00:20:15.919" end="00:20:21.600" style="s2">You&#39;re just a liar.</p>
<p begin="00:20:19.360" end="00:20:23.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You guys are insane. You&#39;re trying to</p>
<p begin="00:20:21.600" end="00:20:28.360" style="s2">kick the CEO out of her own party.</p>
<p begin="00:20:23.360" end="00:20:28.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Harrison, stop talking nonsense.</p>
<p begin="00:20:29.120" end="00:20:35.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You all right?</p>
<p begin="00:20:32.400" end="00:20:38.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. Just a bit tired.</p>
<p begin="00:20:35.440" end="00:20:39.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:20:38.000" end="00:20:42.080" style="s2">Why are you in such a hurry to leave me?</p>
<p begin="00:20:39.760" end="00:20:45.120" style="s2">Huh? Because of him.</p>
<p begin="00:20:42.080" end="00:20:47.789" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s none of your business.</p>
<p begin="00:20:45.120" end="00:20:49.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just come home with me.</p>
<p begin="00:20:47.789" end="00:20:51.760" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:20:49.760" end="00:20:54.760" style="s2">Go home with Chloe. You two deserve each</p>
<p begin="00:20:51.760" end="00:20:54.760" style="s2">other.</p>
<p begin="00:20:55.840" end="00:21:03.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my god. She is the CEO. [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:21:00.320" end="00:21:05.679" style="s2">What&#39;s going to happen to our family?</p>
<p begin="00:21:03.280" end="00:21:07.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even if Mr. Harrison says she&#39;s the CEO,</p>
<p begin="00:21:05.679" end="00:21:08.559" style="s2">doesn&#39;t mean it&#39;s true. They seem quite</p>
<p begin="00:21:07.200" end="00:21:09.120" style="s2">close. How long have they been seeing</p>
<p begin="00:21:08.559" end="00:21:11.840" style="s2">each other?</p>
<p begin="00:21:09.120" end="00:21:14.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough. This is humiliating.</p>
<p begin="00:21:11.840" end="00:21:18.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jeremy, where are you going?</p>
<p begin="00:21:14.400" end="00:21:18.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I need to talk to her in person.</p>
<p begin="00:21:18.559" end="00:21:26.960" style="s2">But Victoria is Mr. Harrison right now.</p>
<p begin="00:21:23.280" end="00:21:31.240" style="s2">Maybe you should wait. Are you okay? You</p>
<p begin="00:21:26.960" end="00:21:31.240" style="s2">still have feelings for her, do you?</p>
<p begin="00:21:31.600" end="00:21:36.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I</p>
<p begin="00:21:32.880" end="00:21:40.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about me? I saved your life. Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:21:36.880" end="00:21:40.919" style="s2">you remember what you promised?</p>
<p begin="00:21:43.360" end="00:21:50.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. Yes, of course. I did. Look, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:21:47.600" end="00:21:53.039" style="s2">take care of the baby as I said I would.</p>
<p begin="00:21:50.559" end="00:21:54.640" style="s2">Go get some rest. I&#39;ll be with you soon.</p>
<p begin="00:21:53.039" end="00:21:56.480" style="s2">The Pinnacle Group has pulled a plug in</p>
<p begin="00:21:54.640" end="00:22:01.159" style="s2">our project. The company&#39;s in chaos and</p>
<p begin="00:21:56.480" end="00:22:01.159" style="s2">a stock is tanking. What&#39;s the plan?</p>
<p begin="00:22:04.960" end="00:22:10.480" style="s2">They really just canled it.</p>
<p begin="00:22:07.919" end="00:22:12.320" style="s2">Why isn&#39;t she picking up?</p>
<p begin="00:22:10.480" end="00:22:14.400" style="s2">Mr. Collins, perhaps she&#39;s blocked your</p>
<p begin="00:22:12.320" end="00:22:16.400" style="s2">number.</p>
<p begin="00:22:14.400" end="00:22:18.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:22:16.400" end="00:22:20.640" style="s2">Let&#39;s just say Mrs. Collins feels a</p>
<p begin="00:22:18.159" end="00:22:22.080" style="s2">little threatened. Threatened. She would</p>
<p begin="00:22:20.640" end="00:22:25.720" style="s2">threaten our relationship with the</p>
<p begin="00:22:22.080" end="00:22:25.720" style="s2">Harrison. Look,</p>
<p begin="00:22:26.880" end="00:22:30.240" style="s2">the point is that she wants a divorce</p>
<p begin="00:22:28.640" end="00:22:33.919" style="s2">and is now just running away with</p>
<p begin="00:22:30.240" end="00:22:36.159" style="s2">another man. It&#39;s ridiculous.</p>
<p begin="00:22:33.919" end="00:22:38.159" style="s2">Look, the point is that she wants a</p>
<p begin="00:22:36.159" end="00:22:40.480" style="s2">divorce and is now just running away</p>
<p begin="00:22:38.159" end="00:22:43.039" style="s2">with another man.</p>
<p begin="00:22:40.480" end="00:22:44.880" style="s2">It&#39;s ridiculous.</p>
<p begin="00:22:43.039" end="00:22:46.720" style="s2">People always refuse to admit to their</p>
<p begin="00:22:44.880" end="00:22:48.320" style="s2">mistakes.</p>
<p begin="00:22:46.720" end="00:22:52.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:22:48.320" end="00:22:54.880" style="s2">You talk to yourself again?</p>
<p begin="00:22:52.320" end="00:22:56.799" style="s2">This is an expensive suit. Expensive?</p>
<p begin="00:22:54.880" end="00:22:59.600" style="s2">How much am I paying you again? Oh,</p>
<p begin="00:22:56.799" end="00:23:01.440" style="s2">clearly not enough. Anyway, the Pinnacle</p>
<p begin="00:22:59.600" end="00:23:03.200" style="s2">Group CEO is attending our charity</p>
<p begin="00:23:01.440" end="00:23:05.280" style="s2">auction in 2 days. Would you like to</p>
<p begin="00:23:03.200" end="00:23:06.640" style="s2">attend it? Yes, I would like to attend.</p>
<p begin="00:23:05.280" end="00:23:08.400" style="s2">I need to talk to her and get this</p>
<p begin="00:23:06.640" end="00:23:10.320" style="s2">contract back. Do you realize the</p>
<p begin="00:23:08.400" end="00:23:11.840" style="s2">pressure on me and my family? Do you</p>
<p begin="00:23:10.320" end="00:23:16.080" style="s2">realize how much this is the pressure on</p>
<p begin="00:23:11.840" end="00:23:18.240" style="s2">me? I I just Look, you&#39;ll be okay. Just</p>
<p begin="00:23:16.080" end="00:23:21.360" style="s2">put on your finest suit. We&#39;ll make it</p>
<p begin="00:23:18.240" end="00:23:23.760" style="s2">happen. Understand? [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:23:21.360" end="00:23:24.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks. All right. Let&#39;s go get this</p>
<p begin="00:23:23.760" end="00:23:27.400" style="s2">deal.</p>
<p begin="00:23:24.400" end="00:23:27.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:23:30.720" end="00:23:36.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here you go.</p>
<p begin="00:23:33.360" end="00:23:38.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:23:36.320" end="00:23:40.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You feeling any better? I feel like a</p>
<p begin="00:23:38.640" end="00:23:42.480" style="s2">complete idiot.</p>
<p begin="00:23:40.640" end="00:23:45.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Still thinking about him?</p>
<p begin="00:23:42.480" end="00:23:47.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah. I just</p>
<p begin="00:23:45.280" end="00:23:49.440" style="s2">I&#39;m so embarrassed. I feel like everyone</p>
<p begin="00:23:47.760" end="00:23:51.760" style="s2">knows.</p>
<p begin="00:23:49.440" end="00:23:55.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, come on. You&#39;ve done nothing wrong</p>
<p begin="00:23:51.760" end="00:23:58.159" style="s2">here. He&#39;s the one who&#39;s cheated.</p>
<p begin="00:23:55.360" end="00:23:59.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah. I just I can&#39;t get my head around</p>
<p begin="00:23:58.159" end="00:24:01.039" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:23:59.679" end="00:24:04.480" style="s2">Don&#39;t know what to do.</p>
<p begin="00:24:01.039" end="00:24:06.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is there anything I can do?</p>
<p begin="00:24:04.480" end="00:24:09.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really?</p>
<p begin="00:24:06.880" end="00:24:09.880" style="s2">H</p>
<p begin="00:24:10.320" end="00:24:15.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why did you bring me here?</p>
<p begin="00:24:12.400" end="00:24:16.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Surprise?</p>
<p begin="00:24:15.200" end="00:24:20.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is the surprise.</p>
<p begin="00:24:16.400" end="00:24:22.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look, Victoria, gorgeous, successful. I</p>
<p begin="00:24:20.480" end="00:24:25.279" style="s2">know things didn&#39;t really go well with</p>
<p begin="00:24:22.480" end="00:24:27.216" style="s2">Jeremy, but I just want you to know</p>
<p begin="00:24:25.279" end="00:24:28.880" style="s2">there are good guys out there.</p>
<p begin="00:24:27.216" end="00:24:31.440" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:24:28.880" end="00:24:33.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not really feeling that.</p>
<p begin="00:24:31.440" end="00:24:34.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m kidding. We need a new model for our</p>
<p begin="00:24:33.200" end="00:24:37.120" style="s2">campaign.</p>
<p begin="00:24:34.480" end="00:24:40.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You could have just said that.</p>
<p begin="00:24:37.120" end="00:24:40.679" style="s2">I&#39;ll get the drinks.</p>
<p begin="00:24:42.282" end="00:24:44.302" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:24:57.760" end="00:25:02.480" style="s2">How do you do it, Victoria?</p>
<p begin="00:25:00.640" end="00:25:06.559" style="s2">You got Jeremy wrapped around your</p>
<p begin="00:25:02.480" end="00:25:09.279" style="s2">finger. Oh, Victoria. First you seduced</p>
<p begin="00:25:06.559" end="00:25:12.760" style="s2">Daniel and now you are with escorts.</p>
<p begin="00:25:09.279" end="00:25:12.760" style="s2">[ __ ] much.</p>
<p begin="00:25:14.960" end="00:25:21.520" style="s2">I think I need to show Jeremy your true</p>
<p begin="00:25:16.880" end="00:25:23.840" style="s2">colors. Hey Jeremy, guess what? My</p>
<p begin="00:25:21.520" end="00:25:27.600" style="s2">friend just saw Victoria with several</p>
<p begin="00:25:23.840" end="00:25:32.772" style="s2">male models at a bar.</p>
<p begin="00:25:27.600" end="00:25:32.772" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Victoria, it&#39;s over for you. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:25:33.520" end="00:25:36.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Victoria,</p>
<p begin="00:25:36.960" end="00:25:41.232" style="s2">&gt;&gt; what are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:25:38.320" end="00:25:43.252" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get your asses out of here now.</p>
<p begin="00:25:41.232" end="00:25:43.252" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:25:50.402" end="00:25:53.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:25:50.880" end="00:25:54.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you think you&#39;re doing?</p>
<p begin="00:25:53.039" end="00:25:56.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The question is, what are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:25:54.720" end="00:25:59.039" style="s2">Drinking with a bunch of guys at a at a</p>
<p begin="00:25:56.240" end="00:26:00.880" style="s2">bar this late.</p>
<p begin="00:25:59.039" end="00:26:03.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re divorced.</p>
<p begin="00:26:00.880" end="00:26:04.000" style="s2">Okay. You have no right to tell me what</p>
<p begin="00:26:03.520" end="00:26:05.600" style="s2">to do.</p>
