<p begin="00:41:25.520" end="00:41:30.400" style="s2">sure. Mrs. Collins, you have to help me.</p>
<p begin="00:41:28.400" end="00:41:32.319" style="s2">If Victoria impresses a CEO of Pinnick</p>
