<p begin="00:44:49.680" end="00:44:52.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And if you did, I just want to say one</p>
<p begin="00:44:51.839" end="00:44:54.960" style="s2">thing to you.</p>
<p begin="00:44:52.720" end="00:44:57.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I care about you. I don&#39;t love you and</p>
<p begin="00:44:54.960" end="00:45:00.480" style="s2">you don&#39;t love me. So why keep hurting</p>
<p begin="00:44:57.760" end="00:45:01.920" style="s2">each other? After 3 years of marriage,</p>
<p begin="00:45:00.480" end="00:45:03.680" style="s2">you were only nice to me when you felt</p>
