<p begin="00:52:56.319" end="00:52:58.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jeremy, I can&#39;t believe she played you</p>
<p begin="00:52:57.680" end="00:53:00.079" style="s2">like this.</p>
<p begin="00:52:58.880" end="00:53:02.319" style="s2">It&#39;s her.</p>
<p begin="00:53:00.079" end="00:53:05.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Answer it. Tell her I&#39;m seriously hurt</p>
<p begin="00:53:02.319" end="00:53:07.760" style="s2">and don&#39;t say anything else.</p>
<p begin="00:53:05.280" end="00:53:09.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How&#39;s it going?</p>
<p begin="00:53:07.760" end="00:53:10.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, I messed up her face. She&#39;s in</p>
<p begin="00:53:09.599" end="00:53:12.720" style="s2">ICU.</p>
<p begin="00:53:10.400" end="00:53:16.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well done. That cow deserved the money&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:53:12.720" end="00:53:16.280" style="s2">in your account already.</p>
<p begin="00:53:16.960" end="00:53:22.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good job. Stay put. Don&#39;t say anything</p>
<p begin="00:53:20.240" end="00:53:25.760" style="s2">else. Okay. I&#39;m going to need you to go</p>
<p begin="00:53:22.800" end="00:53:28.000" style="s2">along this in a couple of days.</p>
<p begin="00:53:25.760" end="00:53:30.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What have you got planned? It&#39;s been a</p>
<p begin="00:53:28.000" end="00:53:34.880" style="s2">while since I attended Akma&#39;s event.</p>
<p begin="00:53:30.640" end="00:53:35.599" style="s2">Perhaps it&#39;s time for a comeback.</p>
<p begin="00:53:34.880" end="00:53:38.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cool.</p>
<p begin="00:53:35.599" end="00:53:41.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We will invite Jeremy, his mother, and</p>
<p begin="00:53:38.319" end="00:53:41.319" style="s2">Chloe.</p>
<p begin="00:53:43.920" end="00:53:48.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How do I get you back, Mr. Collins?</p>
<p begin="00:53:46.960" end="00:53:50.000" style="s2">After Miss Mitchell sold your wife&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:53:48.400" end="00:53:52.240" style="s2">wedding ring, she regularly sent money</p>
<p begin="00:53:50.000" end="00:53:54.160" style="s2">overseas. Did you find out more details</p>
<p begin="00:53:52.240" end="00:53:56.240" style="s2">about the account?</p>
<p begin="00:53:54.160" end="00:53:57.520" style="s2">I did not. After Chloe sent money,</p>
<p begin="00:53:56.240" end="00:54:00.640" style="s2">something happened to Victoria. There</p>
<p begin="00:53:57.520" end="00:54:03.520" style="s2">has to be a link. Keep digging.</p>
<p begin="00:54:00.640" end="00:54:05.920" style="s2">But last time I asked you to check into</p>
<p begin="00:54:03.520" end="00:54:08.920" style="s2">Victoria&#39;s hospital records. Any</p>
<p begin="00:54:05.920" end="00:54:08.920" style="s2">findings?</p>
<p begin="00:54:09.359" end="00:54:13.280" style="s2">She visited an orthopedic and</p>
<p begin="00:54:10.960" end="00:54:17.400" style="s2">dermatologist 3 years ago for broken</p>
<p begin="00:54:13.280" end="00:54:17.400" style="s2">right arm and severe burns.</p>
<p begin="00:54:18.960" end="00:54:24.040" style="s2">three years ago during the Collins Group</p>
<p begin="00:54:21.040" end="00:54:24.040" style="s2">fire.</p>
<p begin="00:54:26.720" end="00:54:33.440" style="s2">What if Victoria saved me and not Chloe?</p>
<p begin="00:54:30.000" end="00:54:35.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wake up, Jeremy. Wake up. We should</p>
<p begin="00:54:33.440" end="00:54:37.440" style="s2">leave now.</p>
<p begin="00:54:35.359" end="00:54:40.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Collins, there&#39;s one more thing.</p>
<p begin="00:54:37.440" end="00:54:42.640" style="s2">Just say it. Mrs. Collins had a prenatal</p>
<p begin="00:54:40.640" end="00:54:45.517" style="s2">checkup during her last visit at the</p>
<p begin="00:54:42.640" end="00:54:47.537" style="s2">hospital. She was two months pregnant.</p>
<p begin="00:54:45.517" end="00:54:47.537" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:54:51.760" end="00:54:58.760" style="s2">Wait,</p>
<p begin="00:54:53.839" end="00:54:58.760" style="s2">what? Victoria is pregnant.</p>
<p begin="00:54:58.800" end="00:55:03.920" style="s2">We&#39;re going to have a baby. I Why didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:55:01.200" end="00:55:05.839" style="s2">you tell me about this?</p>
<p begin="00:55:03.920" end="00:55:09.200" style="s2">Your baby?</p>
<p begin="00:55:05.839" end="00:55:13.000" style="s2">What&#39;s wrong with the baby?</p>
<p begin="00:55:09.200" end="00:55:13.000" style="s2">She miscarried it.</p>
<p begin="00:55:16.240" end="00:55:22.880" style="s2">I didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:55:18.720" end="00:55:26.160" style="s2">I didn&#39;t I didn&#39;t know.</p>
<p begin="00:55:22.880" end="00:55:29.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How is my little one? I&#39;m sorry. The</p>
<p begin="00:55:26.160" end="00:55:29.880" style="s2">baby has already miscarried.</p>
<p begin="00:55:30.880" end="00:55:34.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s all my fault.</p>
<p begin="00:55:36.160" end="00:55:44.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah. Well, that is what I said.</p>
<p begin="00:55:40.240" end="00:55:46.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well done, Chloe. The Pinnacle Group has</p>
<p begin="00:55:44.160" end="00:55:49.359" style="s2">invited us to its CEO&#39;s comeback</p>
<p begin="00:55:46.559" end="00:55:51.440" style="s2">banquet.</p>
<p begin="00:55:49.359" end="00:55:53.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Isn&#39;t that Chloe? Didn&#39;t she cause that</p>
<p begin="00:55:51.440" end="00:55:54.880" style="s2">drama between Megan and Avery last time?</p>
<p begin="00:55:53.280" end="00:55:57.040" style="s2">What&#39;s she doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:55:54.880" end="00:55:59.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What nonsense are you talking about?</p>
<p begin="00:55:57.040" end="00:56:01.359" style="s2">Khloe is part of the Collins group and</p>
<p begin="00:55:59.119" end="00:56:03.200" style="s2">soon to be part of our family. Everyone</p>
<p begin="00:56:01.359" end="00:56:05.359" style="s2">knows the Collins family lost that 10</p>
<p begin="00:56:03.200" end="00:56:08.400" style="s2">billion project to the Pinnet Group. She</p>
<p begin="00:56:05.359" end="00:56:10.480" style="s2">shouldn&#39;t be so confident.</p>
<p begin="00:56:08.400" end="00:56:11.920" style="s2">That was a misunderstanding. The fact</p>
<p begin="00:56:10.480" end="00:56:13.839" style="s2">that we are invited here shows the</p>
<p begin="00:56:11.920" end="00:56:14.880" style="s2">Pinnacle Group still values the Collins</p>
<p begin="00:56:13.839" end="00:56:17.359" style="s2">family.</p>
<p begin="00:56:14.880" end="00:56:19.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Precisely. Perhaps we&#39;ll discuss future</p>
<p begin="00:56:17.359" end="00:56:24.440" style="s2">contracts. Chloe runs the show at the</p>
<p begin="00:56:19.920" end="00:56:24.440" style="s2">Collins Group. What have you all done?</p>
<p begin="00:56:26.389" end="00:56:29.880" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:56:26.880" end="00:56:29.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe.</p>
<p begin="00:56:30.079" end="00:56:33.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, Jeremy.</p>
<p begin="00:56:32.939" end="00:56:34.880" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:56:33.440" end="00:56:36.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How are you? How&#39;s the baby?</p>
<p begin="00:56:34.880" end="00:56:38.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The baby&#39;s fine.</p>
<p begin="00:56:36.799" end="00:56:40.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. Look, I want to say sorry for</p>
<p begin="00:56:38.720" end="00:56:43.400" style="s2">running off the other nights. It wasn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:56:40.400" end="00:56:43.400" style="s2">cool.</p>
<p begin="00:56:45.520" end="00:56:50.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:56:47.440" end="00:56:52.319" style="s2">Are we okay?</p>
<p begin="00:56:50.160" end="00:56:55.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello everyone.</p>
<p begin="00:56:52.319" end="00:56:57.440" style="s2">Welcome to the CEO comeback bash. And</p>
<p begin="00:56:55.520" end="00:57:01.960" style="s2">now I&#39;m going to introduce you to the</p>
<p begin="00:56:57.440" end="00:57:01.960" style="s2">CEO of the Pinnacle Group.</p>
<p begin="00:57:07.920" end="00:57:14.440" style="s2">Hello everybody. I am the CEO of the</p>
<p begin="00:57:10.880" end="00:57:14.440" style="s2">Pinnacle Group.</p>
<p begin="00:57:15.599" end="00:57:23.429" style="s2">She&#39;s supposed to be in the ICU.</p>
<p begin="00:57:19.599" end="00:57:23.429" style="s2">What&#39;s she doing? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:57:25.994" end="00:57:30.720" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:57:27.760" end="00:57:34.200" style="s2">Hello everybody. I am the CEO of the</p>
<p begin="00:57:30.720" end="00:57:34.200" style="s2">Pinnacle Group.</p>
<p begin="00:57:34.559" end="00:57:39.599" style="s2">She was supposed to be in the ICU.</p>
<p begin="00:57:36.480" end="00:57:43.319" style="s2">What&#39;s she doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:57:39.599" end="00:57:43.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you just say?</p>
<p begin="00:57:43.680" end="00:57:48.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:57:46.640" end="00:57:52.359" style="s2">I&#39;m just surprised Victoria would stir</p>
<p begin="00:57:48.880" end="00:57:52.359" style="s2">things up today.</p>
<p begin="00:57:52.720" end="00:57:59.040" style="s2">She&#39;s a total [ __ ]</p>
<p begin="00:57:55.440" end="00:58:02.240" style="s2">trying to pass herself off as the CE of</p>
<p begin="00:57:59.040" end="00:58:04.240" style="s2">Pinnacle Group again.</p>
<p begin="00:58:02.240" end="00:58:07.760" style="s2">This time we can&#39;t let it happen.</p>
<p begin="00:58:04.240" end="00:58:10.720" style="s2">Attention everyone, Victoria&#39;s a fake.</p>
<p begin="00:58:07.760" end="00:58:14.160" style="s2">She&#39;s been cozing up to Mr. Harrison and</p>
<p begin="00:58:10.720" end="00:58:16.319" style="s2">pretend to be the CEO in their absence.</p>
<p begin="00:58:14.160" end="00:58:17.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, would you for once in your life</p>
<p begin="00:58:16.319" end="00:58:23.079" style="s2">just be quiet?</p>
<p begin="00:58:17.520" end="00:58:23.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why, stop this. She&#39;s asked for this.</p>
<p begin="00:58:28.960" end="00:58:35.040" style="s2">The CEO of Pinnacle has never shown up</p>
<p begin="00:58:31.359" end="00:58:38.000" style="s2">before. It is weird that appear now. The</p>
<p begin="00:58:35.040" end="00:58:40.160" style="s2">Pinnacle Grow Group is a global giant. I</p>
<p begin="00:58:38.000" end="00:58:42.000" style="s2">can&#39;t imagine their CEO being some young</p>
<p begin="00:58:40.160" end="00:58:45.040" style="s2">woman.</p>
<p begin="00:58:42.000" end="00:58:46.480" style="s2">She must be a fraud. Victoria,</p>
<p begin="00:58:45.040" end="00:58:48.799" style="s2">why do you keep stirring things up for</p>
<p begin="00:58:46.480" end="00:58:50.319" style="s2">the Collins family? Consider your</p>
<p begin="00:58:48.799" end="00:58:53.599" style="s2">relationship with Jeremy. Why do you</p>
<p begin="00:58:50.319" end="00:58:55.280" style="s2">keep making him look bad?</p>
<p begin="00:58:53.599" end="00:58:55.839" style="s2">Seems like you are the one causing the</p>
<p begin="00:58:55.280" end="00:58:58.720" style="s2">trouble.</p>
<p begin="00:58:55.839" end="00:59:00.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How dare you? We could have sealed the</p>
<p begin="00:58:58.720" end="00:59:02.640" style="s2">deal with the pinnacle group if it</p>
<p begin="00:59:00.160" end="00:59:04.960" style="s2">wasn&#39;t for you. If you continue like</p>
<p begin="00:59:02.640" end="00:59:07.839" style="s2">this, I&#39;ll have</p>
<p begin="00:59:04.960" end="00:59:10.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; what?</p>
<p begin="00:59:07.839" end="00:59:11.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I um</p>
<p begin="00:59:10.319" end="00:59:16.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ll do what?</p>
<p begin="00:59:11.839" end="00:59:19.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I um as a deputy CEO, you can&#39;t defend</p>
<p begin="00:59:16.640" end="00:59:21.200" style="s2">her without cause, even if she is your</p>
<p begin="00:59:19.119" end="00:59:22.799" style="s2">lover.</p>
<p begin="00:59:21.200" end="00:59:25.920" style="s2">lover.</p>
<p begin="00:59:22.799" end="00:59:30.200" style="s2">Victoria is my younger sister.</p>
<p begin="00:59:25.920" end="00:59:30.200" style="s2">Your younger sister?</p>
<p begin="00:59:30.400" end="00:59:35.119" style="s2">Your younger sister?</p>
<p begin="00:59:32.880" end="00:59:37.200" style="s2">Not just that.</p>
<p begin="00:59:35.119" end="00:59:40.960" style="s2">Victoria single-handedly founded the</p>
<p begin="00:59:37.200" end="00:59:43.040" style="s2">Pinnacle Group. She&#39;s the CEO.</p>
<p begin="00:59:40.960" end="00:59:46.359" style="s2">Here&#39;s the proof.</p>
<p begin="00:59:43.040" end="00:59:46.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No way.</p>
<p begin="00:59:47.760" end="00:59:52.240" style="s2">Victoria, you&#39;re the CEO of Pinnacle</p>
<p begin="00:59:50.559" end="00:59:53.920" style="s2">Group. Why didn&#39;t you tell me all this</p>
<p begin="00:59:52.240" end="00:59:56.240" style="s2">time?</p>
<p begin="00:59:53.920" end="00:59:57.920" style="s2">Why keep it a secret?</p>
<p begin="00:59:56.240" end="00:59:59.920" style="s2">3 years ago, the Collins Group was on</p>
<p begin="00:59:57.920" end="01:00:02.079" style="s2">the brink of bankruptcy.</p>
<p begin="00:59:59.920" end="01:00:05.520" style="s2">Victoria sacrificed everything. She</p>
<p begin="01:00:02.079" end="01:00:08.319" style="s2">married you to save you. What are you</p>
<p begin="01:00:05.520" end="01:00:12.880" style="s2">saying? She&#39;s been providing resources</p>
<p begin="01:00:08.319" end="01:00:15.760" style="s2">secretly to the Collins group for years.</p>
<p begin="01:00:12.880" end="01:00:19.760" style="s2">Without her, you are nothing.</p>
<p begin="01:00:15.760" end="01:00:24.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, Jeremy, don&#39;t listen to him. She</p>
<p begin="01:00:19.760" end="01:00:24.119" style="s2">must have paid him to deceive you.</p>
<p begin="01:00:24.720" end="01:00:29.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re the liar here. Why not tell</p>
<p begin="01:00:27.440" end="01:00:32.599" style="s2">everyone who the real father of your</p>
<p begin="01:00:29.359" end="01:00:32.599" style="s2">baby is?</p>
<p begin="01:00:34.000" end="01:00:39.200" style="s2">Why not tell everyone who the real</p>
<p begin="01:00:35.520" end="01:00:42.880" style="s2">father of your baby is?</p>
<p begin="01:00:39.200" end="01:00:42.880" style="s2">I don&#39;t know what you&#39;re talking about.</p>
<p begin="01:00:44.960" end="01:00:49.599" style="s2">Chloe&#39;s baby is Jeremy&#39;s.</p>
<p begin="01:00:48.240" end="01:00:50.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe, do you have something to say to</p>
<p begin="01:00:49.599" end="01:00:52.880" style="s2">me?</p>
<p begin="01:00:50.240" end="01:00:54.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wow, this is so juicy.</p>
<p begin="01:00:52.880" end="01:00:57.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What a scandal.</p>
<p begin="01:00:54.880" end="01:01:00.079" style="s2">Let me introduce you all to the guy in</p>
<p begin="01:00:57.359" end="01:01:05.000" style="s2">that picture, the real father of Khloe&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:01:00.079" end="01:01:05.000" style="s2">baby. No, it&#39;s not what it looks like.</p>
<p begin="01:01:05.520" end="01:01:10.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How do you explain these photos? You</p>
<p begin="01:01:09.280" end="01:01:13.839" style="s2">lied TO ME.</p>
<p begin="01:01:10.880" end="01:01:16.480" style="s2">THIS ENTIRE TIME.</p>
<p begin="01:01:13.839" end="01:01:18.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s all a setup. [screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:01:16.480" end="01:01:21.040" style="s2">She set me up. I don&#39;t even know this</p>
<p begin="01:01:18.960" end="01:01:23.599" style="s2">guy.</p>
<p begin="01:01:21.040" end="01:01:25.920" style="s2">You have to believe me, Jeremy. She must</p>
<p begin="01:01:23.599" end="01:01:27.680" style="s2">have plotted this with him. Please make</p>
<p begin="01:01:25.920" end="01:01:30.880" style="s2">them delete those photos.</p>
<p begin="01:01:27.680" end="01:01:34.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Deleting the photos won&#39;t help you.</p>
<p begin="01:01:30.880" end="01:01:36.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing here? [gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:01:34.160" end="01:01:39.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t you once say you love me the</p>
<p begin="01:01:36.000" end="01:01:39.000" style="s2">most?</p>
<p begin="01:01:40.160" end="01:01:44.760" style="s2">Deleting the photos won&#39;t help you.</p>
<p begin="01:01:45.377" end="01:01:47.397" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:01:49.040" end="01:01:52.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="01:01:51.760" end="01:01:54.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You</p>
<p begin="01:01:52.720" end="01:01:57.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; didn&#39;t you once say you love me the</p>
<p begin="01:01:54.799" end="01:01:59.280" style="s2">most? You left Jeremy 3 years ago to be</p>
<p begin="01:01:57.520" end="01:02:05.027" style="s2">with me abroad and now you want to</p>
<p begin="01:01:59.280" end="01:02:07.047" style="s2">leave. Chloe, you are carrying my child.</p>
<p begin="01:02:05.027" end="01:02:07.047" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:02:08.240" end="01:02:13.760" style="s2">I didn&#39;t even know you.</p>
<p begin="01:02:11.760" end="01:02:15.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We agreed to come back here to scam</p>
<p begin="01:02:13.760" end="01:02:18.079" style="s2">money from the Collins family and split</p>
<p begin="01:02:15.520" end="01:02:18.559" style="s2">it evenly. Why are you turning on me</p>
<p begin="01:02:18.079" end="01:02:21.119" style="s2">now?</p>
<p begin="01:02:18.559" end="01:02:23.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe, what the hell is happening?</p>
<p begin="01:02:21.119" end="01:02:25.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s lying. Get him out of here.</p>
<p begin="01:02:23.359" end="01:02:27.353" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s enough.</p>
<p begin="01:02:25.333" end="01:02:27.353" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:02:27.359" end="01:02:31.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jeremy, I swear I don&#39;t know this man.</p>
<p begin="01:02:30.573" end="01:02:33.520" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:02:31.520" end="01:02:36.480" style="s2">Victoria must have set this up to frame</p>
<p begin="01:02:33.520" end="01:02:40.240" style="s2">me. They&#39;ve hired him and then faked</p>
<p begin="01:02:36.480" end="01:02:42.720" style="s2">evidence to ruin me.</p>
<p begin="01:02:40.240" end="01:02:44.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ruin? Don&#39;t you remember how you got</p>
<p begin="01:02:42.720" end="01:02:46.000" style="s2">pregnant?</p>
<p begin="01:02:44.079" end="01:02:48.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up.</p>
<p begin="01:02:46.000" end="01:02:50.720" style="s2">I&#39;ll sue you for defamation. I&#39;ll call</p>
<p begin="01:02:48.319" end="01:02:53.200" style="s2">the cops and have you arrested.</p>
<p begin="01:02:50.720" end="01:02:56.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Defamation? [gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:02:53.200" end="01:02:59.200" style="s2">You and I both know</p>
<p begin="01:02:56.000" end="01:03:02.400" style="s2">who baby Oscar&#39;s father is.</p>
<p begin="01:02:59.200" end="01:03:05.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe, you told me I was the father. Why</p>
<p begin="01:03:02.400" end="01:03:06.559" style="s2">do you lie to me?</p>
<p begin="01:03:05.119" end="01:03:08.640" style="s2">Jeremy, NO.</p>
<p begin="01:03:06.559" end="01:03:11.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU [ __ ] LIE TO ME. WHY? YOU RUINED</p>
<p begin="01:03:08.640" end="01:03:13.680" style="s2">MY LIFE. YOU RUINED MY MARRIAGE. YOU</p>
<p begin="01:03:11.040" end="01:03:16.680" style="s2">MADE me hurt Victoria. YOU RUINED MY</p>
<p begin="01:03:13.680" end="01:03:16.680" style="s2">LIFE.</p>
<p begin="01:03:19.043" end="01:03:22.640" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:03:19.520" end="01:03:24.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NO, I didn&#39;t do anything wrong.</p>
<p begin="01:03:22.640" end="01:03:29.240" style="s2">Get off me this instant.</p>
<p begin="01:03:24.720" end="01:03:29.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You wanted your lover to attack me.</p>
<p begin="01:03:31.920" end="01:03:36.559" style="s2">No, I didn&#39;t know anything about that.</p>
<p begin="01:03:35.039" end="01:03:38.799" style="s2">He acted alone.</p>
<p begin="01:03:36.559" end="01:03:40.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You liar. I HAVE RECORDINGS AND</p>
<p begin="01:03:38.799" end="01:03:45.640" style="s2">transaction records showing that you</p>
<p begin="01:03:40.400" end="01:03:45.640" style="s2">paid me. You can&#39;t deny it.</p>
<p begin="01:03:46.400" end="01:03:52.559" style="s2">Miss Harrison,</p>
<p begin="01:03:48.720" end="01:03:55.520" style="s2">I&#39;ve come clean. Can you let me go?</p>
<p begin="01:03:52.559" end="01:03:56.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s enough. Stop all these lies.</p>
<p begin="01:03:55.520" end="01:03:59.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jeremy, [gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:03:56.480" end="01:04:02.160" style="s2">I know I messed up, okay? But Victoria</p>
<p begin="01:03:59.119" end="01:04:03.599" style="s2">is all right, isn&#39;t she? I promise I</p>
<p begin="01:04:02.160" end="01:04:06.079" style="s2">won&#39;t do it again.</p>
<p begin="01:04:03.599" end="01:04:07.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Begging will do nothing. We have enough</p>
<p begin="01:04:06.079" end="01:04:10.799" style="s2">evidence to send you to prison for a</p>
<p begin="01:04:07.920" end="01:04:14.079" style="s2">very long time.</p>
<p begin="01:04:10.799" end="01:04:16.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; JEREMY. JEREMY. [screaming] JEREMY. I</p>
<p begin="01:04:14.079" end="01:04:19.280" style="s2">DID IT BECAUSE I LOVE YOU. I DIDN&#39;T WANT</p>
<p begin="01:04:16.960" end="01:04:21.200" style="s2">Victoria to take you away from me.</p>
<p begin="01:04:19.280" end="01:04:25.319" style="s2">Remember who risked everything to take</p>
<p begin="01:04:21.200" end="01:04:25.319" style="s2">you out of that fire. Please</p>
<p begin="01:04:25.520" end="01:04:30.160" style="s2">remember who risked everything to take</p>
<p begin="01:04:27.440" end="01:04:32.000" style="s2">you out of that fire. Please, [gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:04:30.160" end="01:04:36.440" style="s2">please,</p>
<p begin="01:04:32.000" end="01:04:36.440" style="s2">please just help me.</p>
<p begin="01:04:36.960" end="01:04:41.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How could you bring up the fire?</p>
<p begin="01:04:38.559" end="01:04:43.440" style="s2">Victoria saved me, not you.</p>
<p begin="01:04:41.440" end="01:04:45.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you trying to say?</p>
<p begin="01:04:43.440" end="01:04:47.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you hadn&#39;t take credit for it, I</p>
<p begin="01:04:45.920" end="01:04:51.359" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t thought that you&#39;d done it. But</p>
<p begin="01:04:47.760" end="01:04:53.839" style="s2">you didn&#39;t. You ruined my life. You made</p>
<p begin="01:04:51.359" end="01:04:57.039" style="s2">me believe something that&#39;s not true.</p>
<p begin="01:04:53.839" end="01:05:00.720" style="s2">You ruined Victoria.</p>
<p begin="01:04:57.039" end="01:05:02.960" style="s2">You made me hurt Victoria.</p>
<p begin="01:05:00.720" end="01:05:06.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you going to abandon me? You</p>
<p begin="01:05:02.960" end="01:05:08.400" style="s2">promised to make things right.</p>
<p begin="01:05:06.559" end="01:05:10.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Make things right. We&#39;re not going to</p>
<p begin="01:05:08.400" end="01:05:12.160" style="s2">make things right.</p>
<p begin="01:05:10.640" end="01:05:13.760" style="s2">You&#39;re going to get taken away and</p>
<p begin="01:05:12.160" end="01:05:18.839" style="s2">you&#39;re going to face the consequences of</p>
<p begin="01:05:13.760" end="01:05:18.839" style="s2">your action. No. [screaming] No.</p>
<p begin="01:05:21.119" end="01:05:28.440" style="s2">He defended Chloe</p>
<p begin="01:05:24.079" end="01:05:28.440" style="s2">because he thought she saved him.</p>
<p begin="01:05:29.200" end="01:05:32.920" style="s2">Take her away.</p>
<p begin="01:05:39.870" end="01:05:45.039" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:05:40.480" end="01:05:49.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Victoria, run in hell.</p>
<p begin="01:05:45.039" end="01:05:49.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jeremy. Jeremy.</p>
<p begin="01:05:51.280" end="01:05:56.245" style="s2">Freeze.</p>
<p begin="01:05:52.160" end="01:05:58.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU ALL ROT IN [screaming] HELL.</p>
<p begin="01:05:56.245" end="01:05:58.880" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:05:58.210" end="01:06:00.880" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="01:05:58.880" end="01:06:04.319" style="s2">Call an ambulance.</p>
<p begin="01:06:00.880" end="01:06:10.520" style="s2">Jeremy. Jeremy. Jeremy. I don&#39;t need you</p>
<p begin="01:06:04.319" end="01:06:10.520" style="s2">to do that. Help. Jeremy.</p>
<p begin="01:06:12.319" end="01:06:15.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Victoria.</p>
<p begin="01:06:14.000" end="01:06:17.915" style="s2">Victoria.</p>
<p begin="01:06:15.680" end="01:06:17.915" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HELP. [screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:06:18.640" end="01:06:25.400" style="s2">JEREMY, JEREMY, call an ambulance. No,</p>
<p begin="01:06:22.400" end="01:06:25.400" style="s2">please.</p>
<p begin="01:06:27.030" end="01:06:28.640" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="01:06:27.520" end="01:06:31.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Victoria.</p>
<p begin="01:06:28.640" end="01:06:33.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jeremy.</p>
<p begin="01:06:31.359" end="01:06:35.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I just need to see you. Please don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:06:33.520" end="01:06:37.119" style="s2">leave me. Please.</p>
<p begin="01:06:35.200" end="01:06:39.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jeremy, [sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:06:37.119" end="01:06:41.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; what? What happened?</p>
<p begin="01:06:39.760" end="01:06:42.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe has been charged for attempted</p>
<p begin="01:06:41.440" end="01:06:44.960" style="s2">murder. She&#39;s going to prison several</p>
<p begin="01:06:42.799" end="01:06:46.799" style="s2">years without bail.</p>
<p begin="01:06:44.960" end="01:06:48.799" style="s2">You must be done with her. I want</p>
<p begin="01:06:46.799" end="01:06:50.480" style="s2">nothing to do with her. She&#39;s hurt you</p>
<p begin="01:06:48.799" end="01:06:53.119" style="s2">and has permanently damaged the image of</p>
<p begin="01:06:50.480" end="01:06:55.359" style="s2">the company. She&#39;s she&#39;s psychotic.</p>
<p begin="01:06:53.119" end="01:06:57.039" style="s2">We&#39;re not divorced yet. We&#39;ve been</p>
<p begin="01:06:55.359" end="01:07:00.280" style="s2">through so much together. You can&#39;t just</p>
<p begin="01:06:57.039" end="01:07:00.280" style="s2">leave me.</p>
<p begin="01:07:00.799" end="01:07:04.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jeremy,</p>
<p begin="01:07:02.079" end="01:07:06.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I love you. Always have.</p>
<p begin="01:07:04.960" end="01:07:08.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you only saying this to me because</p>
<p begin="01:07:06.400" end="01:07:09.680" style="s2">I&#39;m I&#39;m the CEO of the Pinnacle Group</p>
<p begin="01:07:08.240" end="01:07:13.319" style="s2">and you want to be involved in the 10</p>
<p begin="01:07:09.680" end="01:07:13.319" style="s2">billion project?</p>
<p begin="01:07:14.079" end="01:07:21.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, Victoria. No, I&#39;ve I&#39;ve I I&#39;ve only</p>
<p begin="01:07:17.680" end="01:07:25.039" style="s2">loved you from the start. Only you,</p>
<p begin="01:07:21.839" end="01:07:28.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jeremy. So much has happened.</p>
<p begin="01:07:25.039" end="01:07:31.359" style="s2">Khloe&#39;s done so much damage. How can we</p>
<p begin="01:07:28.160" end="01:07:33.839" style="s2">recover from that?</p>
<p begin="01:07:31.359" end="01:07:38.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry that all this has happened. I</p>
<p begin="01:07:33.839" end="01:07:41.480" style="s2">just want to give us another chance.</p>
<p begin="01:07:38.000" end="01:07:41.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I should go.</p>
<p begin="01:07:42.640" end="01:07:48.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ready to go? You can check out. Here&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:07:45.200" end="01:07:51.720" style="s2">something for you. I had it repaired and</p>
<p begin="01:07:48.160" end="01:07:51.720" style="s2">I hope you like it.</p>
<p begin="01:07:54.480" end="01:07:58.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jeremy,</p>
<p begin="01:07:56.160" end="01:08:01.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Victoria, I know our relationship would</p>
<p begin="01:07:58.960" end="01:08:04.160" style="s2">be like this gown now. They may be</p>
<p begin="01:08:01.359" end="01:08:06.720" style="s2">fixed, but there will always be marks. I</p>
<p begin="01:08:04.160" end="01:08:08.640" style="s2">can&#39;t change what&#39;s happened, but but</p>
<p begin="01:08:06.720" end="01:08:11.599" style="s2">I&#39;ll always be there for you. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:08:08.640" end="01:08:13.520" style="s2">always love you.</p>
<p begin="01:08:11.599" end="01:08:15.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Me, too.</p>
<p begin="01:08:13.520" end="01:08:17.679" style="s2">I don&#39;t want to get back to my old life.</p>
<p begin="01:08:15.680" end="01:08:19.520" style="s2">I want to run my own company again. I</p>
<p begin="01:08:17.679" end="01:08:20.880" style="s2">want to be Avery for Hollix&#39;s again. I</p>
<p begin="01:08:19.520" end="01:08:23.040" style="s2">don&#39;t want to be Victoria Collins</p>
<p begin="01:08:20.880" end="01:08:24.960" style="s2">anymore.</p>
<p begin="01:08:23.040" end="01:08:27.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As head of your own company, you must</p>
<p begin="01:08:24.960" end="01:08:30.319" style="s2">understand.</p>
<p begin="01:08:27.120" end="01:08:33.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll always be here for you.</p>
<p begin="01:08:30.319" end="01:08:35.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Me, too.</p>
<p begin="01:08:33.600" end="01:08:38.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe we could collaborate in the</p>
<p begin="01:08:35.279" end="01:08:38.279" style="s2">future.</p>
<p begin="01:08:38.719" end="01:08:40.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How are you today?</p>
<p begin="01:08:39.839" end="01:08:43.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="01:08:40.239" end="01:08:45.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you ready to go home? Barry,</p>
<p begin="01:08:43.120" end="01:08:47.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; anything else I should know?</p>
<p begin="01:08:45.600" end="01:08:50.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I think it&#39;s all good. Thank you so</p>
<p begin="01:08:47.279" end="01:08:50.279" style="s2">much.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
